{% comment %}
  Custom robots.txt: Shopify defaults preserved + custom sitemap reference.
  NOTE: Shopify ka default /sitemap.xml override NAHI ho sakta - wo platform
  level par auto-generate hota hai. Isliye custom sitemap /pages/custom-sitemap
  par serve hota hai aur yahan reference kiya gaya hai. Usko Google Search
  Console me alag se submit karna hoga.
{% endcomment %}
{% for group in robots.default_groups %}
  {{- group.user_agent -}}
  {% for rule in group.rules %}
    {{- rule -}}
  {% endfor %}
  {{- group.sitemap -}}
{% endfor %}
Sitemap: {{ shop.url }}/pages/custom-sitemap
